; --- The waystone. TravelName is a LOCALE KEY, not prose (38K): TravelNodeComponent resolves it
; --- through Loc.T, and Loc.T returns an unknown string unchanged, so a mistyped key renders as the
; --- key itself rather than failing.
[node name="CrosswayWaystone" type="Node3D" parent="."]
