; --- The wardens ----------------------------------------------------------------
; Moved here from town_hub.tscn, which is where 38M had to leave them: the toll existed and the road
; did not. They stand on the SOUTH side of the gate, so papers are bought before the crossing.
;
; ⚠️ TWO ENTITIES, NOT ONE WITH TWO SERVICES. EntityNode.GetComponent<T> returns the first child
; match, so a permit and a bribe on one body leaves the second one unreachable and silent (38E).
;
; They are NOT parented to Nav: only static geometry should carve the navmesh.
[node name="RoadWarden" type="Node3D" parent="."]
